er></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-content__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>\nComplaint &amp; Feedback\n</h2>\n<p>Guest Relations thanks you for taking the time to submit your feedback. Your comments will be carefully reviewed, and the necessary action will be taken.\n<br>\n<br>\nThis form is intended for submitting complaints, claims, or feedback related to past flights or services.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>For reservation support or inquiries about an upcoming flight, please contact our contact center at +966 920022222.</li>\n    <li>For online booking support or payment-related issues, please contact our Sales Support team using the <a href=\"/en-SA/forms/sales-support-form\">Sales Support Form</a>&nbsp;.</li>\n    <li>If you are submitting this request on behalf of a traveler, please review the third-party requirements before proceeding. <a href=\"/en-SA/Support/HelpAndSupport/FAQs\">FAQs</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please select the service type so we can assist you further.</p>\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-dyna